{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>ינחלו</b> Three times in the Masorah: here; ולשמות מטות אבותם ינחלו (and to the names of the tribes of their fathers they shall inherit); כבוד חכמים ינחלו (the honor of the wise they shall inherit). אשר ינחלו לשמות מטות אבותם ינחלו — for those who came out of Egypt the land was divided, and likewise לשמות מטות אבותם ינחלו — the sages: in five things a father acquires for his son, and he teaches: in wisdom."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:23:46.353537300Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}